WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.620
I'm Robert Hasler and I'm from South Lake
Texas. I graduated from Covenant Christian

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:10.619
Academy in 2011. I'm now a senior at Hillsdale
College majoring in Financial Management,

00:00:10.619 --> 00:00:16.100
and I work downtown at the Lenten Associates, Part
of the Washington Hillsdale Internship Program.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.800
The Washington Hillsdale Internship Program,
we

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.839
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere
between ten to twenty students a semester

00:00:23.839 --> 00:00:28.800
out to DC. They take two or three classes
and they intern on the hill, at the Heritage

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.320
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.
When we find somebody coming out of college

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.699
who has some practical real world experience,
especially experience that applies to what

00:00:38.699 --> 00:00:44.129
we do, it really sets them apart. Washington
is one of those places that kids can learn

00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:49.579
a lot and gain a lot just from being hear
a few moths. And in that since, coming here

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:53.440
and having that interning experience I guarantee
will be life changing.

